00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:05.600
it will often be more motivational&nbsp;
to the opponents of that person,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.920
to the members of the party that is in&nbsp;
opposition to the winner of the White House.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:14.160
And so you'll see them come out in larger numbers&nbsp;
in the following midterms. That's typically the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:17.200
way it goes. I don't know that that's the&nbsp;
way twenty, twenty two will go, though.&nbsp;

